# Protected TLA+ contracts require explicit human review.
/spec/tla/protected/ @husams
/spec/tla/trusted/ @husams
/spec/tla/modules/CidxTypes.tla @husams
/spec/tla/models/*.cfg @husams
# HSE-89: TLAPS proofs and exported counterexamples are trust artifacts --
# an AI agent must not weaken a proof obligation or replace a golden
# counterexample to make a gate green.
/spec/tla/proofs/ @husams
/spec/tla/counterexamples/golden/ @husams
# HSE-89 review fix: the policy files that DEFINE what is protected and who
# owns it must themselves be protected, or a change could edit them to
# silently narrow protectedPaths or replace the owner before the same PR
# merges. check-protected-review.sh resolves both files from the base commit
# specifically so this cannot be bypassed by editing them at HEAD.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @husams
/spec/tla/manifest.json @husams
